    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Get In Touch</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Visit Our Clinic</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray-600);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;">Have questions or need to schedule an appointment? Our team is ready to assist you. We offer same-day appointments for dental emergencies.</p>
        <div class="contact-info-card">
          <div class="contact-info-icon"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i></div>
          <div><h4>Our Location</h4><p>No 911, HIG, 35HG+G8M, 1st Main Rd, Mogappair Eri Scheme, Mogappair, Chennai, Greater Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600037</p></div>
        </div>
